{"3426850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chronicles of Veldoria", "steam_appid": 3426850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Shared team turns</strong> — your whole party splits one pool of actions. Hit a weakness and it grows; miss and it shrinks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧬 <strong>Monster fusion</strong> — recruit Veldomon and fuse them into your party and gear for abilities you can't get otherwise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Two leads</strong> — play as Alex or Elizabeth across six elemental regions, each with their own dialogue.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You know that feeling when a tough enemy almost beats you, and then you realize you can turn around and use it? That's Veldoria. Fight something, fuse it, make it yours. Pick Alex or Elizabeth and set out to figure out what's slowly poisoning this world, because right now, nobody else is trying to stop it. If you grew up on old-school JRPGs, this will feel like home.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/3d24ab0b021cc3c68142042b68ca2fe9.avif?t=1787795828\" width=1292 height=176 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your party doesn't take turns one at a time — your whole team shares a pool of actions each round. Hit an enemy weakness and the pool grows: another character acts, then another, while the enemy waits. Miss, and the pool shrinks, ending your round early.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then the enemy side runs the same system against you. One bad round doesn't just cost you an action — it can hand them several in a row. If you've played Shin Megami Tensei, you'll know the feeling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So every choice costs something. Do you spend your last action healing Greg, or gamble on an attack that might hit a weakness and buy you two more?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/60a49189777ac9807d59f1e7765223db.poster.avif?t=1787795828\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/60a49189777ac9807d59f1e7765223db.webm?t=1787795828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/60a49189777ac9807d59f1e7765223db.mp4?t=1787795828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/66a887458b1bc0764314c6d4b44a0f14.avif?t=1787795828\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras_big/66a887458b1bc0764314c6d4b44a0f14.avif?t=1787795828 width=1560 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land of Veldoria is inhabited by monsters known as &quot;Veldomon&quot;. Not every Veldomon needs to be defeated. Help the right ones through optional side quests, and they'll choose to fight alongside you instead. Fuse them into your party, your weapons, even your armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, which will you choose?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Weapons</strong> — add an attack element, boost offensive stats, or unlock signature attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ <strong>Armor</strong> — resist elements and pick up passive defensive traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 <strong>Party members</strong> — increase all stats and learn new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/6cb2640e06aa838b21051683b0636968.avif?t=1787795828\" width=1191 height=1121 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/79b308859b36b64c7652e539b84433d2.avif?t=1787795828\" width=944 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Alex or Elizabeth. Your pick leads the party in the field and changes how characters speak to you along the way — the same corruption, seen from a different seat. Your choices across Veldoria decide how it ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/2c3665484937b87c4634ed3741db58a2.poster.avif?t=1787795828\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/2c3665484937b87c4634ed3741db58a2.webm?t=1787795828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/2c3665484937b87c4634ed3741db58a2.mp4?t=1787795828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/43c17f0ca0760d2c09a5501c776f9936.avif?t=1787795828\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras_big/43c17f0ca0760d2c09a5501c776f9936.avif?t=1787795828 width=1560 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/11c4c3ac074a16b84aa636750803dc31.poster.avif?t=1787795828\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/11c4c3ac074a16b84aa636750803dc31.webm?t=1787795828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/11c4c3ac074a16b84aa636750803dc31.mp4?t=1787795828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up, spend JP to learn new skills, synthesize items, merge equipment, and reshape your party formation. Six regions of enemies, each with their own weaknesses — the build that carried you through the forest won't carry you through the mines.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You know that feeling when a tough enemy almost beats you, and then you realize you can turn around and use it? That's Veldoria. Fight something, fuse it, make it yours. Pick Alex or Elizabeth and set out to figure out what's slowly poisoning this world, because right now, nobody else is trying to stop it. If you grew up on old-school JRPGs, this will feel like home.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/3d24ab0b021cc3c68142042b68ca2fe9.avif?t=1787795828\" width=1292 height=176 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your party doesn't take turns one at a time — your whole team shares a pool of actions each round. Hit an enemy weakness and the pool grows: another character acts, then another, while the enemy waits. Miss, and the pool shrinks, ending your round early.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then the enemy side runs the same system against you. One bad round doesn't just cost you an action — it can hand them several in a row. If you've played Shin Megami Tensei, you'll know the feeling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So every choice costs something. Do you spend your last action healing Greg, or gamble on an attack that might hit a weakness and buy you two more?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/60a49189777ac9807d59f1e7765223db.poster.avif?t=1787795828\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/60a49189777ac9807d59f1e7765223db.webm?t=1787795828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/60a49189777ac9807d59f1e7765223db.mp4?t=1787795828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/66a887458b1bc0764314c6d4b44a0f14.avif?t=1787795828\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras_big/66a887458b1bc0764314c6d4b44a0f14.avif?t=1787795828 width=1560 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land of Veldoria is inhabited by monsters known as &quot;Veldomon&quot;. Not every Veldomon needs to be defeated. Help the right ones through optional side quests, and they'll choose to fight alongside you instead. Fuse them into your party, your weapons, even your armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, which will you choose?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Weapons</strong> — add an attack element, boost offensive stats, or unlock signature attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡️ <strong>Armor</strong> — resist elements and pick up passive defensive traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 <strong>Party members</strong> — increase all stats and learn new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/6cb2640e06aa838b21051683b0636968.avif?t=1787795828\" width=1191 height=1121 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/79b308859b36b64c7652e539b84433d2.avif?t=1787795828\" width=944 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Alex or Elizabeth. Your pick leads the party in the field and changes how characters speak to you along the way — the same corruption, seen from a different seat. Your choices across Veldoria decide how it ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/2c3665484937b87c4634ed3741db58a2.poster.avif?t=1787795828\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/2c3665484937b87c4634ed3741db58a2.webm?t=1787795828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/2c3665484937b87c4634ed3741db58a2.mp4?t=1787795828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras/43c17f0ca0760d2c09a5501c776f9936.avif?t=1787795828\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426850/extras_big/43c17f0ca0760d2c09a5501c776f9936.avif?t=1787795828 width=1560 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\